    "title": "What stores are closed on Easter Sunday today? Is Target open on Easter? Costco? Here's a list",
    "text": "April 4, 2026Updated April 5, 2026, 7:19 a.m. ETMany major retailers, including Target and Costco, will be closed on Easter Sunday.Several stores like Walmart, Kroger, and CVS are expected to remain open for the holiday.Shoppers are advised to call their local stores to confirm holiday hours as exceptions may occur.The article provides lists of stores anticipated to be open and closed for Easter 2026.Will Easter shopping be possible on Easter Sunday?Some stores are open on Easter Day, but several are also closed. Is Target open for Easter? Is Costco closed on the holiday?Here's what we know about which Easter stores are closed and open:Is Target open on Easter Sunday 2026? Is the store closed on Easter Day?Target stores are closed on Easter Sunday.Is Costco closed on Easter Sunday 2026? Is the store open on Easter Day?Costco stores are closed on Easter Sunday.List of stores closed Easter Sunday 2026: What stores are not open on tomorrow on Easter Day?Here's a list of stores expected to be closed on Easter Sunday. Each of these stores will have some location closures for Easter, or are expected to be closed based on recent holiday closures. Please call ahead to your local store, as there are always exceptions:AldiAppleBanana RepublicBath and Body WorksBest BuyBloomingdale'sBob's Discount FurnitureBurlingtonThe Container StoreCostcoCrate + BarrelDick's Sporting GoodFive BelowGapGoodwillH-E-B GroceryThe Honey Baked Ham CompanyHobby LobbyJCPenneyKohl'sHomeGoodsLowe'sMacy'sMarshallsMichael'sNordstromNordstrom RackOffice DepotPublixSam's ClubStaplesSuperCutsTargetT.J. MaxxList of stores open Easter Sunday 2026: What stores are not closed tomorrow on Easter Day?Here's a list of stores expected to be open on Easter Sunday. Each of these stores will be open at most locations on Easter, or are expected to be open based on recent holiday participation. Please call ahead to your local store, as there are always exceptions:Ace HardwareAlbertson'sBarnes & NobleBass Pro ShopsBig LotsBJs Wholesale ClubCabela'sCVSDollar GeneralFresh MarketOrder groceries with InstacartHome DepotIKEAKrogerOld NavyPetcoPetSmartRite AidSafewayStarbucksTrader Joe'sWalmartWalgreensWhole FoodsWhen is Easter 2027? What date is Easter Sunday next year?Easter 2027 will be celebrated on Sunday, March 28, 2027, for most Christians, predominantly Catholics and Protestants.Save on Easter supplies with Amazon PrimeChris Sims is a trending reporter at Midwest Connect Gannett. Follow him on Twitter: @ChrisFSims.Our editors independently choose our recommendations. Some content is produced with paid support from a third party, however our editorial decisions remain independent. If you buy through our links, the USA TODAY Network may earn a commission. Prices and availability may change.",
